	(text_box "U6 = PROXIMITY (DNP v1): LDC1612 inductive - gate-side detection (v2).\nU6 LDC1612 = DNP v2 footprint (unpopulated v1, spec 1/4.6). Coil = 14 mm spiral on CH0 (footprint retained, v2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 236.22 0)
		(size 52 14.46)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01aa94b9-3160-4175-abdd-91dcabe7cc5f")
	)
	(text_box "ANTENNA KEEPOUT (SIM UBX-21000517 App.B p.70): no traces/vias in ANY layer in the antenna strip clearance area.\nInternal antenna: ANT_INT(5)-ANT(6) bridge. Corner placement -> ANT_PCB(1) = GND pattern, ANT_GND1/2 (2,3) NC.\nStackup must be checked vs u-blox reference (certification). Keep U8/IS31 clear of antenna strip (IS31 ds EMI note)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.86 74.44 0)
		(size 111.78 14.46)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0f34c026-c581-404a-9d4a-9271ef38fe06")
	)
	(text_box "U1 = MAIN MCU: ANNA-B402 (u-blox nRF52833, Cortex-M4F 64 MHz, BLE 5.1 + integrated antenna).\nSystem brain: gate-timing state machine (ARMED-LOGGING-POST_RUN), BLE download transport + OTA,\nRawRunStore host on U7, BHI260AP host on U8.\nI2C MAP (spec 2):\ni2c0 power bus P0.15/P0.16 (PU 100k -> +1V8): 0x36 MAX17048, 0x53 IS31FL3194, 0x6A BQ25120A.\ni2c1 sensor bus P0.22/P0.23: 0x2A LDC1612 (DNP v2), 0x52 RV-3028-C7 (DNP v2, /INT -> TP)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240 185 0)
		(size 68 30)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3a146414-2824-4944-9b02-0220c7232714")
	)
	(text_box "U7 = RUN DATA flash 8 MB (RawRunStore). U2 = BHI FW flash 2 MB. Both QSPI to U1.\nFLASH: U7 = RawRunStore 8 MB (flash layout per hardware doc). U2 = BHI FW flash (Arduino_BHY2 upload) -\nOD-5: ADD U2 to BOM (Nicla parity, populated; missing from BOM v4.3). WP#/HOLD# NC -> internal PU (Macronix Note 1).\nU7/U2 decap 100n = Nicla parity (TBD-JP keep, spec 6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 358.4 197.71 0)
		(size 48 25)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3a9dc4f2-16f8-43d8-9de7-a65ff005ec7a")
	)
	(text_box "U8 = SENSOR-HUB MCU: BHI260AP (integrated Cortex-M0+, BHy2 firmware on U2) -\n6-axis IMU fusion @ 100 Hz -> QSPI FIFO to U1; wake-on-motion triggers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 17.78 0)
		(size 89.84 9)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4792bb52-4bc2-48a5-bdba-017127b35cec")
	)
	(text_box "SGC P1 - ANNA-B402 carrier, 22x55 mm 4-layer (0.8 mm, ENIG) - rev A-WIP - 2026-10-29\nGenerated from sgc_schematic_spec.md v0.1 (92b352e). Every pin/net traceable to the spec;\nTBD-JP items appear as notes only - nothing invented. Regenerate: python3 gen_symbols.py && python3 gen_schematic.py"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140 14 0)
		(size 165 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "683a3a71-44c1-4d91-8506-a922f9b1ea2e")
	)
	(text_box "U3 = POWER: BQ25120A charger PMIC - LiPo charge mgmt (~110 mA), ship mode, button wake.\nCHARGER (spec 4.1/4.7): ISET 1.82k -> ICHG ~110 mA; ILIM 1k -> 200 mA; IPRETERM 4.99k -> 10%; VBATREG default 4.2 V.\nOD-8: /CD -> P0.08 (B402 pin 50, moved from P0.25 - P0.25 does not exist) + 100k PU to V_PMID (ship-mode capable).\nBQ INT -> 100k PU +1V8, NC on MCU (read FAULTS reg, AD-029); /PG TP only. /MR, RESET NC (Nicla P0.18->MR net dropped, C3).\nLS/LDO unused (C4): LSCTRL->GND, VINLS->SYS, LS/LDO 1uF. TS: R_HI (VBUS->TS) + R_LO (TS->GND) + pack NTC - values TBD-JP (OD-4).\ni2c0 pull-ups 100k to +1V8 (Nicla parity; BQ ds suggests 10k - spec chose Nicla parity). USB-IF inrush note OD-14."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 116.84 0)
		(size 132 20.46)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6888a983-70d8-4d73-aa4e-652aec73afcd")
	)
	(text_box "J3 = ARM Cortex Debug 2x5 1.27 mm: 1 VTref(+1V8) 2 SWDIO 3 GND 4 SWDCLK 5 GND 6 SWO 7 KEY-NC 8 TDI-NC 9 GND 10 nRESET(=RESET_N, B402 pin 12 - nothing else on pin 12 except TP).\nOD-2: Tag-Connect TC2050 footprint alternative (castellated pads). SWO = B402 pin 16 (optional)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.95 271.75 0)
		(size 92 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f11e9fc-94f0-46b0-b380-89fc2545a712")
	)
	(text_box "PERIPHERALS / v2 DNP (spec 2/4.3/4.6/4.8):\nSK6812-mini x5 strip: DIN <- P0.19 (B402 pin 38) through dual-supply level translator (VCCA +1V8 / VCCB +5V,\nTXB0102/TXS0102-class - part TBD-JP, OD-9). Strip supply +5V from MT3608 boost (EN -> P0.17 = B402 pin 49, moved\nfrom P0.24 - does not exist; OD-9b: keep P0.19 vs move to full-drive GPIO - decide after R2 bench).\nBoost BOM (hw doc 7.3): L2 4.7uH/2A, C17/C18, R11/R12, C19 - DRAWN as DNP reserve (U10/U11/L2/J4). Strip = OFF-BOARD via J4 (glued to pole / transparent case, JP 2026-11-01) - no SK6812 footprints on PCB.\n32k: Y1 SIT1532AI (OD-10 default FIT) -> XL1 (pin 17); XL2 (18) -> GND; Y1 decap TBD-JP. LFRC-only = EVK alternative.\nUART console TP: TX P0.20 (pin 10) / RX P0.09 (pin 22, NFC1 - no NFC coil on board). TP set per OD-3:\n+1V8, +5V, VBAT, V_PMID, GND, BQ INT, SWD row, UART row, ALRT, LED-data.\nDNP v2 (footprints retained): LDC1612 U6 + 14mm coil (ADDR=GND -> 0x2A; INTB -> BUTTON net per OD-11; CLKIN tie\nGND if internal osc - v2), RV-3028-C7 @0x52 (/INT -> TP, no GPIO steal), BZ1 beeper (P0.09 via 100R/NPN).\nnRF P0.24/P0.25 DO NOT EXIST on B402 (spec C1/C2 pin moves). Module USB (pins 21/34/35) unused - NC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125 185 0)
		(size 105 46)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "78e0009f-1e93-4a25-984c-4706ade9bc12")
	)
	(text_box "USB-C: VBUS 10uF bulk at connector; D+/D- NC; shell stitched to GND.\nESD D5 TBD-JP (OD-13: PESD5V0U2UT vs TPD4E05U06)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.61 87.6 0)
		(size 40 14)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8a6f98a3-4eaf-48de-8b2a-0ea1573c3565")
	)
	(text_box "BATTERY / POWER TREE (spec 4.8/5): Renata ICP622540PMT 600 mAh 3.7 V LiPo, 3-wire NTC pack, JST-3 user-replaceable\n(connector PN TBD-JP, OD-4; pinout per ABX00050 = VBAT/NTC/GND). VSYS is the +1V8 rail (buck default 1.8 V, 300 mA).\nVBAT -> MAX17048 VDD only. V_PMID -> IS31FL3194. Charge 110 mA + system ~25 mA + LED ~23 mA bat-side = 158 mA < ILIM 200 mA.\nSession ~48 mAh -> ~12.5 sessions (hw doc 7); gauge adds ~3 uA (AD-029). Battery capacity 600 mAh per docs (OD-4 confirm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 216 0)
		(size 110 22.76)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8da95128-a23b-4cdc-bffc-ede8ccd1f3c6")
	)
	(text_box "U9 = BARO: BMP390 - altitude/descent pressure sensor (BHI M1 sub-sensor).\nBHI CLUSTER (spec 4.4): BMP390L/BMM150/BME688 are sub-sensors on BHI M1 master port - exact M1/M2/M3 wiring = COPY\nABX00050 (Nicla) at capture (TBD-JP). BME688 DNP per OD-6 (footprint retained). H-IF SPI 16 MHz (app.overlay) on\nP0.03-05 despite Table 4 low-freq remark - risk R1: drop to 8/4 MHz if RF regressions. RESETN -> P0.13 (moved, C3/OD-7).\nHOSTBOOT(3) NC v1 (TBD-JP vs Nicla); VREG(6) NC v1 (decoupling per Bosch ds - TBD-JP, not in spec 6); RESV1-3 NC (do not connect)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 282 100 0)
		(size 122 19.84)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ac3e005d-25c2-42fc-974d-f2a443ba9d51")
	)
	(text_box "U4 = FUEL GAUGE: MAX17048 - LiPo state-of-charge % (i2c0 0x36).\nGAUGE (spec 4.2, AD-029): addr 0x36 fixed; VDD(3)=VBAT sense +0.1uF; CELL(2) NC->GND; CTG/QSTRT->GND.\nALRT(5) OD -> 10k PU +1V8 -> P0.21 (B402 pin 26). OD-12: verify MAX17048 VIH vs 1.8 V pull-ups at review."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 29.66 174.04 0)
		(size 44 19)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b7d8ab3c-8e07-4304-ae3b-72f201fccecb")
	)
	(text_box "U5 = LED DRIVER: IS31FL3194 - RGB status LED (i2c0 0x53).\nLED (spec 4.3): U5 VCC/SDB -> V_PMID (OD-17: confirm SDB net on ABX00050 at capture); decap value TBD-JP.\nIS31 OUT1-3 are current sinks - verify SMLP34RGB2W3 common polarity at capture (spec text says anodes to OUTs)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 147.32 0)
		(size 48 19)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
